    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Welcome to the <color=red>2020 DRL SIM Tryouts</color>, a global competition, open to anyone 16 years or older that seeks to find the next professional DRL pilot. The winner of the tryouts competition will earn a professional pilot contract to compete in the <color=red>2020 DRL season</color>. And for the first time ever, DRL is giving away <color=red>$75K</color> in total prizes throughout this epic, two-month tournament. Score a top place on the leaderboards. Compete in weekly tournaments. Tune-in to watch the action. Everyone has a chance to win.
