  m_Text: 'It''s simple to get started. <color=red>Players must complete 3 heats on the Tryouts Map, and you''re automatically qualified to join the weekly online tournaments.</color> There''s no time cut off. If you can complete the map 3 times, you''re qualified to compete. '
