  m_Text: Once you qualify on the Tryouts Map, you can join any of the 12 weekly tournaments held every <color=red>Tuesday and Thursday between Feb 18th - March 26th</color>. Each week is a different track. During the tournament, you have 30 minutes to set your fastest time in a Solo Race. The Top 24 will battle it out bracket-style to become the overall winner. Every tournament winner automatically advanced to the Finals.
